[12.01, "o", "Cluster kind-cloudpilot-lab, 5 namespaces scanned, scanned 2026-10-03T19:49:30.186Z\r\n"]
[12.06, "o", "Prices: $0.031611 per vCPU-hour, $0.004237 per GiB-hour of memory, $0.04 per GiB-month of storage (OpenCost defaults; set your own with --cpu-hour-usd, --memory-gib-hour-usd, --storage-gib-month-usd)\r\n"]
[12.11, "o", "Usage: Prometheus at monitoring/prometheus:9090, the last 1 hour\r\n"]
[12.16, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.21, "o", "5 findings, $50.64 per month of estimated waste\r\n"]
[12.26, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.31, "o", " 1.   $24.43/mo  Deployment reports requests more than it uses\r\n"]
[12.36, "o", "    Deployment  deployment/reports  shop  rule confidence 40%\r\n"]
[12.41, "o", "    - Container worker requests 300m CPU; its busiest five minutes in the last 60 minutes used under 1m\r\n"]
[12.46, "o", "    - Container worker requests 512Mi memory; the most it held in the last 60 minutes was under 1Mi\r\n"]
[12.51, "o", "    - Suggested: worker cpu 10m, memory 32Mi (the peak plus 15%, never below 10m CPU or 32Mi memory)\r\n"]
[12.56, "o", "    - 3 replicas\r\n"]
[12.61, "o", "    cost: 3 x (290m CPU x $0.031611/vCPU-hour + 0.47 GiB memory x $0.004237/GiB-hour) x 730 h. The money is saved once the freed capacity lets the cluster run fewer or smaller nodes\r\n"]
[12.66, "o", "    fix (CAUTION - review before running):\r\n"]
[12.71, "o", "      kubectl set resources deployment/reports -n shop --context kind-cloudpilot-lab -c worker --requests=cpu=10m,memory=32Mi\r\n"]
[12.76, "o", "    way back: This restarts the pods one by one. To go back: kubectl set resources deployment/reports -n shop --context kind-cloudpilot-lab -c worker --requests=cpu=300m,memory=512Mi. If the workload is deployed by Helm, Argo CD or Flux, change the request there instead, or the next sync undoes this.\r\n"]
